From 0dbf80932063ceb86b2a4e22953fb5819f86c7cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWrt RTL819x bring-up <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 04:41:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rtl819x: build the kernel -Os to fit the 2880 KiB flash slot

Run 41963646153: the little-endian cs6c-wrapped kernel blob (0x2d5292
bytes) exceeded the 0x2d0000 burn slot by ~21 KiB; the kernel-region
boundaries come from the board flash layout and cannot move. The
generic config compiles -O2 (CONFIG_CC_OPTIMIZE_FOR_PERFORMANCE=y);
prefer -Os for this 8 MiB board. KALLSYMS is already off.

Signed-off-by: Sohan Ali <96324905+sohan-f@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 target/linux/rtl819x/rtl8197f/config-6.18 | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/target/linux/rtl819x/rtl8197f/config-6.18 b/target/linux/rtl819x/rtl8197f/config-6.18
index b396ddf..c1a23d5 100644
--- a/target/linux/rtl819x/rtl8197f/config-6.18
+++ b/target/linux/rtl819x/rtl8197f/config-6.18
@@ -85,3 +85,5 @@ CONFIG_PCIE_RTL8197F=y
 CONFIG_GENERIC_PCI_IOMAP=y
 CONFIG_PCI_DOMAINS=y
 # CONFIG_KALLSYMS_UNCOMPRESSED is not set
+# CONFIG_CC_OPTIMIZE_FOR_PERFORMANCE is not set
+CONFIG_CC_OPTIMIZE_FOR_SIZE=y
